WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:05,300
Xiaodeng, with my little Huihui here, I also want to step into the door.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,300
Pure dog, get out of here

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:11,890
You are a pure dog, your whole family is a pure dog

4
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:19,830
Miss Youyou, do you want to play a fun game?

5
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:20,830
what game

6
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:23,830
You first go to your fourth young master’s room and get the world championship medal.

7
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:29,380
But when you take other people’s things, you have to ask your brother first.

8
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:32,380
These are the rules of the game, don’t tell others

9
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:37,230
If you get it, I'll give you ice cream

10
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:38,230
Where is the medal?

11
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:41,220
Don't know the words

12
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:46,030
That's the one on the top shelf

13
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:49,980
What's wrong

14
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:54,170
The shelf is so high, but Yoyo's legs are only so short

15
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:56,300
Trash, then you stand on the waiting list

16
00:00:56,300 --> 00:01:04,700
What happened this time?

17
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:06,700
Hey hey hey, just teasing you

18
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:11,320
I was actually fooled by a three-and-a-half-year-old child

19
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:15,700
Now go to the swimming pool, Miss Jiaojiao is waiting for you to play and win medals

20
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:17,700
Whoever catches it can eat the ice cream

21
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:19,900
But this is my brother’s medal

22
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:21,900
Brother won't mind

23
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:24,900
Can you go and ask your brother, then?
